{"id":"b757d1bcef612349","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-conductor.md","title":"Artin Conductor from Explicit Ramification Data","display":"df-conductor — Artin Conductor from Explicit Ramification Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-conductor","aliases":["58-df-conductor","Conductor"],"display":"df-conductor — Artin Conductor from Explicit Ramification Data","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-conductor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-conductor</span><span>Conductor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conductor — Artin Conductor from Explicit Ramification Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\cdot_G,e_G,E,+_E,\\odot_E,\\rho,H,a,c,S,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(G,\\cdot_G,e_G,E,+_E,\\odot_E,\\rho,H,a,c,S,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(G)\">\\(H:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(G)\\)</span> is a lower-ramification filtration supplied as data, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:G\\to E^E\">\\(\\rho:G\\to E^E\\)</span> is a finite-dimensional complex representation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArtinConductorData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ArtinConductorData}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConductorCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ConductorCode}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conductor\\text{-}local}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArtinConductorData}_S(a,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,E,+_E,\\odot_E,\\rho,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land |G|&lt;\\omega\n\\land e_G\\in G\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_Gg=g\\land g\\cdot_Ge_G=g)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(E,+_E,\\odot_E)\n\\land\\dim_{\\mathbb C}E&lt;\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,E^E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\bigl(\\rho(g\\cdot_Gh)=\\rho(g)\\circ\\rho(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\rho(g),E,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in E\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(g)(x+_Ey)=\\rho(g)(x)+_E\\rho(g)(y)\n\\land\\rho(g)(\\alpha\\odot_Ex)=\\alpha\\odot_E\\rho(g)(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,\\omega,\\mathcal P(G))\n\\land H(0)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(e_G\\in H(i)\n\\land\\forall g,h\\in H(i)\\;(g\\cdot_Gh\\in H(i))\n\\land\\forall g\\in H(i)\\;\\exists h\\in H(i)\\;(g\\cdot_Gh=e_G)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(H(i+1)\\subseteq H(i))\n\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq i\\to H(i)=\\{e_G\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a=\\sum_{i\\in\\omega}\\frac{|H(i)|}{|H(0)|}\n\\left(\\dim_{\\mathbb C}E-\\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\{x\\in E:\\forall g\\in H(i)\\;(\\rho(g)(x)=x)\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conductor\\text{-}local}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArtinConductorData}_S(a,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,E,+_E,\\odot_E,\\rho,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land |G|&lt;\\omega\n\\land e_G\\in G\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_Gg=g\\land g\\cdot_Ge_G=g)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(E,+_E,\\odot_E)\n\\land\\dim_{\\mathbb C}E&lt;\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,E^E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\bigl(\\rho(g\\cdot_Gh)=\\rho(g)\\circ\\rho(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\rho(g),E,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in E\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(g)(x+_Ey)=\\rho(g)(x)+_E\\rho(g)(y)\n\\land\\rho(g)(\\alpha\\odot_Ex)=\\alpha\\odot_E\\rho(g)(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,\\omega,\\mathcal P(G))\n\\land H(0)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(e_G\\in H(i)\n\\land\\forall g,h\\in H(i)\\;(g\\cdot_Gh\\in H(i))\n\\land\\forall g\\in H(i)\\;\\exists h\\in H(i)\\;(g\\cdot_Gh=e_G)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(H(i+1)\\subseteq H(i))\n\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq i\\to H(i)=\\{e_G\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a=\\sum_{i\\in\\omega}\\frac{|H(i)|}{|H(0)|}\n\\left(\\dim_{\\mathbb C}E-\\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\{x\\in E:\\forall g\\in H(i)\\;(\\rho(g)(x)=x)\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conductor\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConductorCode}_S(c,S,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n|S|&lt;\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\alpha,S,\\omega)\\land c=\\alpha.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conductor\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConductorCode}_S(c,S,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n|S|&lt;\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\alpha,S,\\omega)\\land c=\\alpha.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The representation, group identity, ramification filtration, and finite-support exponent code are explicit. The unrelated valuation-ramification atom is no longer treated as if it defined the groups <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{v,i}\">\\(G_{v,i}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A number-field conductor ideal is recovered from the code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> by the separately supplied prime-ideal map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\mapsto\\mathfrak p_v\">\\(v\\mapsto\\mathfrak p_v\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,\\cdot_G,e_G,E,+_E,\\odot_E,\\rho,H,a,c,S,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"H:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:G\\to E^E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArtinConductorData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConductorCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conductor\\text{-}local}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArtinConductorData}_S(a,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,E,+_E,\\odot_E,\\rho,H)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land |G|<\\omega\n\\land e_G\\in G\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_Gg=g\\land g\\cdot_Ge_G=g)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(E,+_E,\\odot_E)\n\\land\\dim_{\\mathbb C}E<\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,E^E)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\bigl(\\rho(g\\cdot_Gh)=\\rho(g)\\circ\\rho(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\rho(g),E,E)\\\\\n&\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in E\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(g)(x+_Ey)=\\rho(g)(x)+_E\\rho(g)(y)\n\\land\\rho(g)(\\alpha\\odot_Ex)=\\alpha\\odot_E\\rho(g)(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,\\omega,\\mathcal P(G))\n\\land H(0)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(e_G\\in H(i)\n\\land\\forall g,h\\in H(i)\\;(g\\cdot_Gh\\in H(i))\n\\land\\forall g\\in H(i)\\;\\exists h\\in H(i)\\;(g\\cdot_Gh=e_G)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(H(i+1)\\subseteq H(i))\n\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq i\\to H(i)=\\{e_G\\})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land a=\\sum_{i\\in\\omega}\\frac{|H(i)|}{|H(0)|}\n\\left(\\dim_{\\mathbb C}E-\\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\{x\\in E:\\forall g\\in H(i)\\;(\\rho(g)(x)=x)\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conductor\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConductorCode}_S(c,S,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n|S|<\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\alpha,S,\\omega)\\land c=\\alpha.","display":true},{"tex":"G_{v,i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"v\\mapsto\\mathfrak p_v","display":false}],"bytes":2701,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-343","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-conductor.md|58-df-conductor]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734","592f9cfb66a507c2","36d7463d215be751","d583890235faf0d5"]}